cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ESC-Fault, please cite it as below."
title: "ESC-Fault: a simulated benchmark for electrostatic chuck fault diagnosis"
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: forgottenl5
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/forgottenl5/esc-fault-benchmark"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/forgottenl5/esc-fault-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Simulated sensor data from 140 electrostatic chucks (semiconductor etch/deposition
  tool part): about 125,000 wafers, 14 signals at 1 Hz, 7 classes including a
  sensor-fault decoy, and three causal tasks (diagnosis, early detection, remaining
  life) with held-out test labels.
keywords:
  - semiconductor
  - electrostatic chuck
  - fault detection
  - fault diagnosis
  - predictive maintenance
  - remaining useful life
  - benchmark
  - synthetic data
